{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122699","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122699/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122699/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122699/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122699","id":5216107846,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAkwYfQ","number":122699,"title":"FileSystem: Fix Collapse/Expand Hierarchy doing nothing in Split Mode","user":{"login":"Parzival-Samanyolu","id":220481853,"node_id":"U_kgDODSRJPQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/220481853?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parzival-Samanyolu","html_url":"https://github.com/Parzival-Samanyolu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parzival-Samanyolu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parzival-Samanyolu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parzival-Samanyolu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parzival-Samanyolu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parzival-Samanyolu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parzival-Samanyolu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parzival-Samanyolu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parzival-Samanyolu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parzival-Samanyolu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-08-21T16:26:15Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T18:05:14Z","closed_at":"2026-09-17T18:05:10Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122699","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122699","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122699.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122699.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Fixes #122663\n\n## Problem\nIn the FileSystem dock's Split Mode, right-clicking a folder in the file list (right panel) and choosing \"Expand Hierarchy\" or \"Collapse Hierarchy\" does nothing. The same action works fine from the tree (left panel).\n\n## Root cause\n`_tree_rmb_option()` (left panel) implements `FILE_MENU_EXPAND_ALL`/`FILE_MENU_COLLAPSE_ALL` by calling `set_collapsed_recursive()` on `tree->get_selected()`. `_file_list_rmb_option()` (right panel, used in Split Mode) instead forwarded every option unconditionally to `_file_option()`, which has no handling for these two — so the click was silently ignored.\n\n## Fix\n`_file_list_rmb_option()` now handles `FILE_MENU_EXPAND_ALL`/`FILE_MENU_COLLAPSE_ALL` explicitly: for a single selected folder, it looks up the corresponding `TreeItem` via the dock's existing `folder_map` (already used elsewhere in this file to go from a path to its tree node) and calls `set_collapsed_recursive()` on it — the same effect as the tree-panel path, just reached via path lookup instead of direct tree selection.\n\n## Testing\nNot compiled or run in this environment. The change is minimal (18 lines) and mirrors an existing, working code path exactly. I'd appreciate a maintainer or reviewer doing a quick manual check (Split Mode → right-click a folder in the file list → Expand/Collapse Hierarchy) before merge; happy to build and verify locally myself if needed.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122699/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122699/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}